Description: LiteLLM custom provider for Puter AI
 LiteLLM-Puter is a custom provider that enables access to 488+ AI models
 through Puter.com's unified API. It provides:
 .
  * Integration with LiteLLM proxy server
  * Support for OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, xAI, Google, Meta and more
  * Automatic token scraping for testing
  * PostgreSQL database with pgvector support
  * Redis caching for improved performance
  * Systemd service for easy deployment
 .
 This package installs the litellm_puter Python module and configures
 a systemd service to run the LiteLLM proxy with Puter integration.
